(1564,'An encyclopedia distributed by a Prontera publisher that is famous for using solid binding in their books.<br />Those struck by this book will swear the binding is diamond hard.<br />Matk +15%<br />Int +3<br />Dex +2<br />Critical +20<br />Critical bonus increases according to the wearer\'s LUK.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Book</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 110</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 200</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 3</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 70</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Priest and<br />Sage Classes;<br />Taekwon Master Job</font>'),
