(1644,'A staff with a jewel in it that causes shockwave every once in a while. The shockwave sometimes nullifies enemy\'s magic defense.<br />Matk +15%, Int +4<br />When you attack using magical ability, it will ignore 10% of their MDEF and deals damage accordingly. The amount ignored will increase depending on the refinement rate of this weapon.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> One-Handed Staff</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 80</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 50</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 3</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 70</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Transcendent Mage and Acolyte</font>'),
