(1646,'A highclass mage\'s staff decorated with rich tail-feathers. It has been especially treated for the ice elemental magical spell, \'Stormgust\'.<br />Matk +15%<br />Int +4, Mdef +1<br />Stormgust\'s damage increases by 1% for each refine level.<br />If refined to +10, casting speed of \'Stormgust\' decreases by 8%.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> One-Handed Staff</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 30</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 50</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 3</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 50</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Transcendent Mage Classes</font>'),
