(4415,'Adds a high chance<br />that defeated monsters<br />will drop Ice Cream.<br />Increases Recovery<br />Rate of Ice Cream<br />by 100%.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#B40088\'> Accessory</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4416,'Reduces cast time of Cold Bolt skill by 25%, and increases that Cold Bolt\'s damage by 25%.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#B40088\'> Accessory</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4417,'Vit +2<br />Has a chance to add a DEF +10 bonus for 10 seconds when the wearer receives physical or magic damage.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#999900\'> Footgear</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4418,'Adds a chance of auto casting <font color=\'#008800\'>Level 2 Cold Bolt</font> with each physical attack.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#B40088\'> Accessory</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4419,'Increases damage to Fire monsters by 50%,<br />adds a chance of auto casting <font color=\'#008800\'>Level 10 Frost Nova</font> when the wearer receives physical or magic damage.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#00CC33\'> Armor</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4420,'Has a chance of auto<br />casting Level 1 Heal and<br />Level 1 Increase AGI to<br />the wearer each time<br />the wearer receives<br />short range physical<br />damage.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Shield</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4421,'Critical +15 bonus when<br />performing long ranged<br />physical attacks.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#FF0000\'> Weapon</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4422,'Flee +5<br />Perfect Dodge +3<br />Increases damage to Water elemental monsters by 10%.<br />Adds a Critical +15 bonus to <font color=\'#6666CC\'>Fish</font> monsters.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#008C99\'> Garment</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4423,'Hit +5<br />Increases damage to Water monsters by 5%.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#B40088\'> Accessory</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4424,'Enables use of <font color=\'#008800\'>Find Stone</font> and <font color=\'#008800\'>Throw Stone</font> skills.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#B40088\'> Accessory</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4425,'Atk +25<br />When in physical attack, Reduces after attack delay by 100% for 10 seconds.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#FF0000\'> Weapon</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4426,'[<font color=\'#6666CC\'>Rogue class</font>]<br />Atk +10%<br />Matk +10%<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#00CC33\'> Armor</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4427,'When compounded into a One-Handed or Two-Handed Sword,<br />Critical +5, HIT +5,<br />increases power of <font color=\'#FF0000\'>Bowling Bash</font> skill by 25%<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#FF0000\'> Weapon</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4428,'When compounded to a Bow,<br />Critical +5, HIT +5,<br />increases the power of the <font color=\'#FF0000\'>Arrow Shower</font> skill by 50%.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#FF0000\'> Weapon</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4429,'Increases damage of the <font color=\'#008800\'>Fire Pillar</font> and <font color=\'#008800\'>Meteor Storm</font> skills by 40%.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#008C99\'> Garment</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4430,'ATK, CRI, HIT is increased depending on the wearer\'s job level.<br />Has a low chance of autocast <font color=\'#FF0000\'>Earthquake</font> when receives a physical attack.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#B40088\'> Accessory</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4431,'Has a chance of auto casting <font color=\'#008800\'>Level 5 Fire Ball</font> or <font color=\'#008800\'>Level 5 Fire Bolt</font> with each physical attack.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#008C99\'> Garment</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4432,'Atk +5<br />Increases physical damage inflicted on Earth monsters by 5%,<br />Critical +15 bonus against Plant and Brute monsters.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#008C99\'> Garment</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4433,'Reduces cast time and increases damage of <font color=\'#FF0000\'>Fire Bolt</font> skill by 25%.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#B40088\'> Accessory</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4434,'Increases damage to formless monsters by 5%.<br />Has a low chance that defeated formless monsters will drop Rough Oridecons or Rough Eluniums.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#6600FF\'> Headgear</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4435,'Increases physical and magical damage to Demihuman enemies by 1%.<br />Recovers 50 HP time a monster is defeated by melee attack.<br />Combined with the Ragged Zombie Card will recover 2 SP each time a <font color=\'#6666CC\'>Demihuman</font> monsters is defeated by melee attack.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#999900\'> Footgear</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4436,'Increases physical<br />and magic damage to<br />Demihuman enemies<br />by 1% with a Critical +5<br />bonus. Adds a low<br />chance of inflicting<br />the Bleeding status<br />to the wearer;<br />wearing with the<br />Zombie Slaughter<br />Card will recover<br />2 SP each time a<br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>Demihuman</font> monster<br />is defeated by<br />melee attack.<br />Compound on:<font color=\'#B40088\'> Accessory</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(4437,'Hit +1<br />Increases recovery rate of Meat by 100%.<br />Each short range physical attack has a low chance of inflicting the Bleeding status to enemies.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Card</font><br />Compound on:<font color=\'#B40088\'> Accessory</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
