(5546,'A magnificent crown created to pay tribute to the 1st sign of the zodiac, Aries the Ram.<br />Attached to the crown is a Diamond gemstone, the birthstone for those born under this sign.<br />Its power increases defense from Fire attacks.<br />Int +3,<br />Increases resistance to <font color=\'#FF0000\'>Fire</font> Element by 7%.<br />If refined to 7 or higher,<br />Matk +2%, Mdef +5.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Headgear</font><br />Defense:<font color=\'#0000FF\'> 3</font><br />Position:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Upper</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 30</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 70</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> All</font>');
