(12937,'A box that contains rental Excalibur. Please handle with care.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Rental Duration:</font> 7 days<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weight:</font> 1<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#000088\'>Rental Item</font><br />The one-handed sword of Arthurian legend that supposedly chooses its owner to wield its holy powers.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />INT +10, LUK +10<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Type:</font> One-Handed Sword<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Attack:</font> 199<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weight:</font> 0<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Element:</font><font color=\'#777777\'> Holy<br /></font><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weapon Level:</font> 4<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Refineable:</font> No<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Requirement:</font><br />Swordsman, Merchant and Thief classes'),
