(13410,'A sword favored by gladiators, it is especially designed for battles against Demihumans.<br />Str +1, Dex +1<br />Increases Physical Attack Strength towards <font color=\'#6666CC\'>Demihuman</font> monsters by 75%.<br />Ignores Physical Defense from <font color=\'#6666CC\'>Demihuman</font> monsters by 20%.<br /><font color=\'#663399\'>Indestructible</font><br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> One-Handed Sword</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 115</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 0</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 3</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 80</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Novice, Swordman, Merchant, Thief Classes</font>'),
(13411,'A sword favored by gladiators, it is especially designed for battles against Demihumans.<br />Str +1, Dex +1<br />Matk +10%<br />Increases Physical Attack Strength towards <font color=\'#6666CC\'>Demihuman</font> monsters by 75%.<br /><font color=\'#663399\'>Indestructible</font><br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> One-Handed Sword</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 115</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 0</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 3</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 80</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Novice, Swordman, Merchant, Thief Classes</font>'),
(13412,'One of the twin swords of Naght Sieger. The blue blade shows the sharpness of this sword.<br />When attacking there is a chance that for 5 seconds you will completely disregard the defense of the opponent.<br />Enables the use <font color=\'#FF0000\'>Lv. 5 Frost Diver</font>.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> One-Handed Sword</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 150</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 150</font><br />Element: <font color=\'#0000BB\'>Water</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 4</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 75</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Transcendent Swordman, Merchant and Thief</font>'),
(13413,'One of the twin swords of Naght Sieger. The red blade shows the destructive power of this sword.<br />When attacking there is a chance that for 5 seconds you will completely disregard the defense of the opponent.<br />Enables the use of <font color=\'#FF0000\'>Lv. 3 Meteor Storm</font>.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> One-Handed Sword</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 160</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 150</font><br />Element:<font color=\'#FF0000\'> Fire</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 4</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 75</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Transcendent Swordman, Merchant and Thief</font>'),
