(13505,'A box contains 1 Executioner<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Rental Duration:</font> 1 Week<br />Item description:<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />A gruesome sword used to behead criminals judged with the death penalty.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Ignores physical defense of <font color=\'#FF0000\'>Demi-Human</font> race by 100%.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Increases Physical Damage against enemies of <font color=\'#FF0000\'>Demi-Human</font> race by 20%<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Increases damage taken from monsters of <font color=\'#FF0000\'>Demi-Human</font> race by 10%.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Type:</font> Two-Handed Sword<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Attack:</font> 190<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weight:</font> 0<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Element:</font><font color=\'#777777\'> Shadow<br /></font><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weapon Level:</font> 4<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Requirement:</font><br />Swordsman classes<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weight:</font> 1'),
