(13508,'A box contains 1 Rudra Bow<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Rental Duration:</font> 1 Week<br />Item description:<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />A bow imbued with the sacred essense of Rudra, one of the ancient gods.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />INT +5<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Enables the use of Level 1 <font color=\'#0000FF\'>Heal</font> and Level 1 <font color=\'#0000FF\'>Cure</font>.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Adds 50% tolerance to the <font color=\'#663399\'>Poison</font>, <font color=\'#663399\'>Curse</font>, <font color=\'#663399\'>Silence</font>, <font color=\'#663399\'>Confuse</font> and <font color=\'#663399\'>Blind</font> statuses.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Type:</font> Bow<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Attack:</font> 185<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weight:</font> 0<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Element:</font><font color=\'#777777\'> Holy<br /></font><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weapon Level:</font> 4<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Requirement:</font><br />Archer and Rogue<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weight:</font> 1'),
