(13513,'A box contains 1 Moonlight Sword<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Rental Duration:</font> 1 Week<br />Item description:<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />A sword imbued with lunar spirit and the power to drain an enemy\'s soul.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />MaxSP +10%<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Regain 3 SP with each attack.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Type:</font> Dagger<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Attack:</font> 85<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weight:</font> 0<br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weapon Level:</font> 4<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Requirement:</font><br />Swordsman, Magician, Archer, Merchant, Thief, Soul Linker and Ninja classes<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br /><font color=\'#0000CC\'>Weight:</font> 1'),
