(16418,'A box containing 500 Giant Fly Wings.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />An enchanted, giant wing from an ancient creatures. Enables instant teleportation of many people when used by a Party Master.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(16419,'A box containing 30 Greed Scrolls, which each enable a single cast of Greed.<br />This scroll has the same restrictions as the normal casting of Greed; some maps do not allow Greed to be used.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(16420,'A pack of consumables to<br />aid the adventurer on the<br />long journey.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Contains:<br />10 Battle Manual<br />10 Bubble Gum<br />20 Lv 10 Agi Scroll<br />20 Lv 10 Blessing Scroll<br />10 Token Of Siegfried<br />10 Life Insurance<br />5 Kafra Card<br />10 Stew of Immortality<br />10 Hwegelmir\'s Tonic<br />10 Steamed Scorpion<br />10 Cooked Nine Tail\'s Tails<br />10 Steamed Tongue<br />10 Dragon Breath Cocktail<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Adventurer Pack can not be<br />traded, dropped, or sold;<br />it can be stored.<br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(16421,'A box that contains 1 Written Oath of Marriage, to be used on your wedding day.<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
(16422,'A box that contains:<br /><font color=\'#000088\'>Rental Item</font><br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>1 Baphomet Horns</font><br />Duration: 7 Days after opening.<br />A headgear made from the horns of Baphomet.<br />Inflicts 12% more damage to Demihumans.<br />Increases ATK based on the wearer\'s Job Lvl.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Headgear</font> Defense : <font color=\'#777777\'>5</font><br />Position:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Upper</font> Weight : <font color=\'#777777\'>80</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> All</font>'),
(16423,'<font color=\'#FF0000\'>This package is tradeable.</font><br /><font color=\'#FF0000\'>The items inside are not.</font><br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />Contains:<br />Episode 13.1 Poporing Key<br />2 Battle Manuals<br />10 Yellow Butterfly Wings<br /><font color=\'#FFFFFF\'>_</font><br />The Episode 13.1 Poporing Key will disappear on <font color=\'#FF0000\'>07/09/09</font> during maintenance;<br />at that time, the Episode 13.1 content will be fully available to everyone on Valkyrie.'),
(16424,'A box that contains:<br /><font color=\'#000088\'>Rental Item</font><br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>1 Executioner</font><br />Duration: 7 Days after opening.<br />A gruesome sword used<br />to behead criminals judged with the death penalty.<br />Pierces physical defense of<br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>Demihuman</font> monsters.<br />Increases damage inflicted on <font color=\'#6666CC\'>Demihuman</font> monsters by 20%, but increases damage received by <font color=\'#6666CC\'>Demihuman</font> monsters by 10%.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Two-handed Sword</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 190</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Element:<font color=\'#777777\'> Shadow</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 4</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Swordman</font>'),
(16425,'A box that contains:<br /><font color=\'#000088\'>Rental Item</font><br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>1 Cutlas</font><br />Duration: 7 Days after opening.<br />A one-handed sword<br />popularized by its use<br />by sea adventurers.<br />Enables use of<br /><font color=\'#008800\'>Level 5 Bash</font>.<br />Str +2<br />Def +1<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> One-Handed Sword</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 185</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 4</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Swordman, Merchant and Thief</font>'),
(16426,'A box that contains:<br /><font color=\'#000088\'>Rental Item</font><br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>1 Moonlight Dagger</font><br />Duration: 7 Days after opening.<br />A dagger imbued with<br />lunar spirit and the power to drain an enemy\'s soul.<br />Regain 3 SP<br />with each attack.<br />MaxSP +10%<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Dagger</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 85</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 71</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 4</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Swordman, Mage, Archer, Merchant, Thief, Soul Linker and Ninja</font>'),
(16427,'A box that contains:<br /><font color=\'#000088\'>Rental Item</font><br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>1 Wrench</font><br />Duration: 7 Days after opening.<br />A heavy tool with many practical applications.<br />Enable a chance of<br />randomly inflicting the <font color=\'#663399\'>Stun</font>, <font color=\'#663399\'>Blind</font>, <font color=\'#663399\'>Poison</font><br />or <font color=\'#663399\'>Frozen</font> statuses with<br />each attack.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Mace</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 150</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 3</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Acolyte</font>'),
(16428,'A box that contains:<br /><font color=\'#000088\'>Rental Item</font><br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>1 Solar Sword</font><br />Duration: 7 Days after opening.<br />A one-handed sword<br />adorned with an engraving of the sun, symbolizing battle spirit and vigor.<br />Regains 1% of the damage inflicted on its target as HP with each attack.<br />Drains 15 SP from its<br />owner every 10 seconds.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> One-handed Sword</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 120</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Element:<font color=\'#FF0000\'> Fire</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 4</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Swordman, Merchant and Thief</font>'),
(16429,'A box that contains:<br /><font color=\'#000088\'>Rental Item</font><br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>1 Tomahawk</font><br />Duration: 7 Days after opening.<br />A light axe imbued with the Wind element which can be hurled at enemies.<br />Enables use of<br /><font color=\'#008800\'>Tomahawk Throwing</font>.<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> One-Handed Axe</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 200</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Element:<font color=\'#33CC00\'> Wind</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 4</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Swordman and Merchant</font>'),
(16430,'A box that contains:<br /><font color=\'#000088\'>Rental Item</font><br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>1 Rudra Bow</font><br />Duration: 7 Days after opening.<br />A bow imbued with the<br />sacred essense of Rudra, one of the ancient gods.<br />Adds 50% tolerance to the Poison, Curse, Silence,<br />Chaos and Blind statuses. Enables the use of<br /><font color=\'#008800\'>Level 1 Heal</font> and<br /><font color=\'#008800\'>Level 1 Cure</font>. INT +5<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Bow</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 185</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Element:<font color=\'#777777\'> Holy</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 4</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Archer Class;<br />Rogue Job</font>'),
(16431,'A box that contains:<br /><font color=\'#000088\'>Rental Item</font><br /><font color=\'#6666CC\'>1 Poll Axe</font><br />Duration: 7 Days after opening<br />A weapon consisting<br />of an axe head mounted<br />on a long pole that<br />is designed to break<br />through thick armor.<br />Str +1, Int +2, Dex +1<br />Class:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> One-Handed Spear</font><br />Attack:<font color=\'#CC0000\'> 195</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Weapon Level:<font color=\'#009900\'> 3</font><br />Level Requirement:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font><br />Jobs:<font color=\'#6666CC\'> Swordman</font>'),
