(16972,'A box that contains 4 costume headgears that convey different patterns of the weather.<br /><font color=\'#FF0000\'>This box can be stored and traded, the items inside are account bound.</font><br />Opening it will give all 4 of the following:<br />-1x Costume: Shining Sun<br />-1x Costume: Rainbow<br />-1x Costume: Lightning Cloud<br />-1x Costume: Rain Cloud<br /><font color=\'#FF0000\'>Once this item opened, it cannot be refunded.</font><br />Weight:<font color=\'#009900\'> 1</font>'),
